To check this, first consider the Čech fppf hypercovering $a : T_\bullet \to T$ with $T_ n = \coprod _{i_0 \ldots i_ n} T_{i_0} \times _ T \ldots \times _ T T_{i_ n}$ and then set $U_\bullet = T_\bullet \times _{a, T} X_ T$. Then $U_\bullet \to X_ T$ is an fppf hypercovering to which we may apply Simplicial Spaces, Lemma <a href="/tag/0DLA" data-tag="0DLA">85.35.2</a>.